# ========================================================
# Sterling Key Properties - Real Email Dispatch Configuration
# ========================================================
# When someone enters their email in the footer, real emails are sent here!
# Choose ANY of the options below:

# OPTION 1: Resend API (Recommended - Free instant setup at https://resend.com)
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_your_api_key_here
# EMAIL_FROM=Sterling Key Intelligence <onboarding@resend.dev>

# OPTION 2: Gmail SMTP (Sends real emails directly from your Gmail account)
# 1. Enable 2-Step Verification on your Google Account
# 2. Go to https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords and create an App Password (16 letters)
# GMAIL_USER=your_email@gmail.com
# GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx

# OPTION 3: Custom Corporate SMTP
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.yourserver.com
# SMTP_PORT=465
# SMTP_USER=intelligence@sterlingkey.com
# SMTP_PASS=your_password
